    <!--
        Approved by product (2026-11-18). The estimate behind it: Gemma 4 31B costs $0.20 / $0.40 per million input /
        output tokens on OpenRouter (2026-11-18), and a managed call (8 context messages) takes about 1,500 to 2,500
        input and 100 to 600 output tokens: roughly $0.0003 to $0.0007, so $4.50 buys about 9,000 calls. These show a
        third of that.
    -->
